      "text": "100 draws · seed 0 · the model clock from start to end\nstart: the explicit time, else the last retained time, else 0\nstate: the latest retained joint state at or before start, advanced\nby the nonlinear SDE; with no histories, the initial-state law\nDiffrax Heun SDE: a diverging path stays non-finite for the checks\ntrue emission laws · with interventions, a paired reference without them",
      "fontSize": 16,
